                                "sense_id": "3fcfa877-7463-3560-b458-ad82bc808c51",
                                "text": "The exposure is rich, racy and instructive. It fully corroborates all the statements of corruption, rascality and \"scuggery\" made by Professor Turner in his recently published report, and will convince the public that the corruption of the recent legislature of Illinois has not one-half been told."
                            },
