                                "sense_id": "3fcfa877-7463-3560-b458-ad82bc808c51",
                                "text": "\"When I'm boss of this dormitory I'll stop that sort of scuggery.\" // \"Scuggery\" was a Whyborough word used to indicate anything unsportsmanlike."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "696166f8-fff7-4559-b89e-65514c8db5fb",
                                "sense_id": "3fcfa877-7463-3560-b458-ad82bc808c51",
                                "text": "the Minister of State for Urban Affairs (Mr. Ouellet) does not care about national unity but will use any kind of skullduggery, thuggery and skuggery to try to keep in office,[…]"
                            },
